invalid type: string "A delivery delay of 7 days or more is considered material.\n\nA delivery delay of 15 days or more should be treated as a\nhigh-severity delivery incident.\n\nSuppliers with repeated material delays should be escalated for\nmanual procurement review.", expected f64ooleanfter its delivery date.\nOnly deliveries completed by the assessment date are observable evidence.\n\nÿÿÿÿÿÿ